## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-6.2 Astra
- **Short description:** OpenAI's next-iteration GPT-6.2 Astra flagship reasoning and multimodal agent model, spotted in cloud infrastructure leaks and model tracker strings. Appears to be a minor-version update to GPT-6 Astra with enhanced capabilities. Not yet officially announced.
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI API (`openai/gpt-6.2-astra`). Paid API tier. Not yet officially released as of November 2026.
- **Release / knowledge:** Unreleased / preview. References found in cloud console filters and community model scrapers. No official OpenAI announcement.
- **IDs:** `openai/gpt-6.2-astra` (no Free ID)
- **Context window:** 1,050,000 tokens (1M) input / 128,000 tokens max output — per meta.json.
- **Modalities:** Text + image in; text out — per meta.json.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** Paid API tier pricing (specific pricing not publicly disclosed for 6.2 variant; GPT-6 Astra priced at $10/$50 per 1M).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary OpenAI. Likely builds on GPT-6 Astra architecture. No open weights, no disclosed parameter counts.

