### Negative findings summary

GPT-6.2 Astra is an unreleased model iteration. All publicly documented benchmarks belong to the predecessor GPT-6 Astra (ARC-AGI-3 99.9%, FrontierMath T4 98%, OSWorld 72.6%, Terminal-Bench Science 64.6%, ExploitBench 100%). These are NOT transferable to the 6.2 designation. No independent evaluation or official announcement exists for GPT-6.2 Astra.

